%% Status: CURRENT — backend implemented, UI trigger not wired
sequenceDiagram
  participant Caller as Trusted caller
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Storage as Private user-materials
  participant Parser as DocumentIngestor
  participant Store as SupabaseContextStore
  Caller->>API: bearer JWT + owned path or text
  API->>Storage: download with caller JWT
  Storage-->>API: owned bytes
  API->>Parser: temporary file/text + metadata
  Parser->>Parser: parse, chunk, count, embed
  Parser->>Store: documents + JSONB embedding chunks
  Store-->>Parser: RLS-protected persistence
  API->>API: delete temporary file in finally
  API-->>Caller: document_id/chunks/token_count
